/**
 * Non-physical asset whose value is derived from a contractual claim, such as bank deposits, bonds, and stocks.
 * Financial assets are usually more liquid than other tangible assets, such as commodities or real estate,
 * and may be traded on financial markets.
 */
entity extendable type FinancialAsset mixes SeedData schema name 'FNCLASST'
